        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="la" source="#robertson" n="Epil." corresp="#wit-sc"><pb n="286" ed="#robertson"/>Teste—R[icardo] episcopo Lundoniae et Rogero episcopo et Ranulfo cancellario et R[odberto] comite de Mellent, apud Rading'.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-sc"><pb n="287" ed="#robertson"/>Witnesses: Richard, Bishop of London, and Bishop Roger and Chancellor Ranulf and Earl Robert de Meulan, at Reading.</ab>
